  <em><center><h1 style="background-color:rgb(82, 112, 171);">Welcome to Our Robotics Website</h1></center></em>
  <p><b>Welcome!</b> We are Team 5 from Group 218 and we proudly present our final robotics project. Our mission is to explore how technology and robotics can help solve real-world problems. This website will guide you through our research, the problem we chose, our robotic solution, and how we developed and programmed it. We focused on the skeletal system, specifically scoliosis, and created a posture-correcting vest to support people with spinal issues. Please explore each section to learn more about our journey and solution. Thank you for visiting our page!</p>

